    "basis": "Approximate physical association: parent80/238, four mapped roof/tower pavilions10/11/13/15, complete layer3 canopy56/118/188/243 and layer2 connector75/149. Parent has two genuine courtyard holes; preserve them in walls, roofs, floors and masks. PMTiles supply no numeric heights for these scoped families. Do not turn layer numbers into surveyed platform heights or claim an exact Wikidata-tagged parent. Source includes an approximately0.72m central facade projection to keep all three observed glazed bays and columns continuous between the clock towers; original map part edges are generalized. Two actual court voids remain open. All heights are original photo-proportioned approximations."
